    "name": "Die For The Lich",
    "steam_appid": 3415570,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll dice and magical trinkets and pair them with weapons to battle legendary monsters. Master the art of chance in a journey where every roll counts. Unlock new gear by completing grueling challenges and prepare for the final battle against the King of undead, the Lich!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/62a8f34e0baaeeec861ab229eec1aaa3.poster.avif?t=1753357387\" width=648 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/62a8f34e0baaeeec861ab229eec1aaa3.webm?t=1753357387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/62a8f34e0baaeeec861ab229eec1aaa3.mp4?t=1753357387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Deck Builder</strong>: Carefully collect dice and trinkets that complement your fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice: </strong>Regular dice are not enough, from dice that roll the best outcome all the way to dice that can predict the roll of other dice, your options are endlessly game-changing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets: </strong>When dice are not enough, use trinkets to shift the outcome, from simply re-rolling a die to creating an army of ghost dice, you'd never run out of ways to manipulate the outcome of a battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>: Each weapon has its own rules and risks, turning every attack into a unique puzzle of precision and luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Characters: </strong>Every adventurer adds new abilities, no two journeys play the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Abilities</strong>: Level up, select unique abilities, and elevate your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters</strong>: Before facing the Lich, battle classic folklore creatures such as the Strigoi, Vetala, and many more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Journey</strong>: You will die many times, but every attempt will be unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Complete challenges to earn new gear and keep every new run feeling fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/9e302755e92045f976b3b1883e9638ef.poster.avif?t=1753357387\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/9e302755e92045f976b3b1883e9638ef.webm?t=1753357387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/9e302755e92045f976b3b1883e9638ef.mp4?t=1753357387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll dice and magical trinkets and pair them with weapons to battle legendary monsters. Master the art of chance in a journey where every roll counts. Unlock new gear by completing grueling challenges and prepare for the final battle against the King of undead, the Lich!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/62a8f34e0baaeeec861ab229eec1aaa3.poster.avif?t=1753357387\" width=648 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/62a8f34e0baaeeec861ab229eec1aaa3.webm?t=1753357387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/62a8f34e0baaeeec861ab229eec1aaa3.mp4?t=1753357387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Deck Builder</strong>: Carefully collect dice and trinkets that complement your fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice: </strong>Regular dice are not enough, from dice that roll the best outcome all the way to dice that can predict the roll of other dice, your options are endlessly game-changing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets: </strong>When dice are not enough, use trinkets to shift the outcome, from simply re-rolling a die to creating an army of ghost dice, you'd never run out of ways to manipulate the outcome of a battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>: Each weapon has its own rules and risks, turning every attack into a unique puzzle of precision and luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Characters: </strong>Every adventurer adds new abilities, no two journeys play the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Abilities</strong>: Level up, select unique abilities, and elevate your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters</strong>: Before facing the Lich, battle classic folklore creatures such as the Strigoi, Vetala, and many more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Journey</strong>: You will die many times, but every attempt will be unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Complete challenges to earn new gear and keep every new run feeling fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/9e302755e92045f976b3b1883e9638ef.poster.avif?t=1753357387\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/9e302755e92045f976b3b1883e9638ef.webm?t=1753357387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/9e302755e92045f976b3b1883e9638ef.mp4?t=1753357387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
